{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 23, "data": [{"docid2": 2202115, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202115.htm", "content": "    三明阳光巴黎小金星幼儿园创办于2005年6月，坐落于优美的三元区下洋新村内，园所总面积2200平方米。幼儿园努力践行指南精神，凸显幼儿自主活动的游戏化、生活化；立足园本，构建园本阅读特色，注重幼儿", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202115.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:46:00", "doctitle": "三明阳光巴黎小金星幼儿园", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412541, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202115.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202114, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202114.htm", "content": "    三明市生态新城康养城幼儿园为三明市教育局直属公办幼儿园，于2023年9月落成启用，与三明市第二实验幼儿园实施“总校制”办学模式。园所坐落于生态新城核心区，毗邻风景秀丽的如意湖湿地公园，占地面积590", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202114.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:45:00", "doctitle": "三明市生态新城康养城幼儿园", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412540, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202114.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202113, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202113.htm", "content": "    福建省三明市农业学校创办于1965年7月，隶属福建省农业农村厅和三明市人民政府，是全国文明校园、首批国家中等职业教育改革发展示范学校、国家级重点中等职业学校、全国教育系统先进集体、教育部首批教", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202113.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:44:00", "doctitle": "三明市农业学校", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412539, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202113.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202112, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202112.htm", "content": "三明市妇联幼儿园创办于1989年，系三明市妇女联合会直属公办幼儿园。1996年通过省级标准化评估，2012年获评市级示范性幼儿园。办园以来，先后荣获“福建省三八红旗集体”“省师德建设先进集体”等多项省级荣誉，以及", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202112.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:43:00", "doctitle": "三明市妇联幼儿园", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412538, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202112.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202111, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202111.htm", "content": "三明市第十六中学，作为三明市域内特色鲜明的专门学校，自 2024年9月5日迎来首批学生入学以来，始终坚定不移地贯彻落实“立足教育，科学矫治，有效转化” 的专门教育指导方针。学校通过一系列富有成效的探索与实践，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202111.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市第十六中学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412537, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202111.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202108, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202108.htm", "content": "    三明市第二实验幼儿园（原名：三明市青少年宫艺术幼儿园）于1993年11月正式创建，属共青团三明市委下属股级事业单位。2010年11月园址由东新一路3号迁移至梅岭路红岩新村11幢。2013年10月更名为三明市第二实", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202108.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:40:00", "doctitle": "三明市第二实验幼儿园", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412531, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202108.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202107, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202107.htm", "content": "    三明市第二中学系市教育局直属高中学校，校园面积72亩。是三明市普通高中的龙头学校。学校创办于1959年10月，1982年被确定为省重点中学，1996年被确定为省一级达标中学，2006年被确定为省首批高中新课程", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202107.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:39:00", "doctitle": "三明市第二中学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412530, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202107.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202106, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202106.htm", "content": "三明第一中学创办于1945年2月，是著名数学家陈景润的母校，坐落于文笔山麓、沙溪河畔。学校底蕴深厚、成绩斐然，1996年成为省一级达标学校，2019年9月复办初中，2020年7月成为普通高中新课程新教材实施国家级示范校，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202106.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:38:00", "doctitle": "三明第一中学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412529, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202106.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202105, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202105.htm", "content": "    三明北附实验学校坐落于福建省三明市生态新城（沙县区），是由福建东盛集团与三明生态新城管委会共同投资，经三明市教育局批准的全日制寄宿制封闭式学校。\n学校占地167亩，总投资约4亿元，集小学、初中", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202105.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:37:00", "doctitle": "三明北附实验学校", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412528, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202105.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202104, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202104.htm", "content": "    华东师范大学附属三明中学（以下简称“华师附中”）作为沪明对口合作重点项目，是由华东师范大学与三明市人民政府合作共建的市属公办完全中学。学校创办于2023年9月，占地约150亩，总建筑面积8.9万平方", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202104.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:35:00", "doctitle": "华东师范大学附属三明中学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412527, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202104.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202103, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202103.htm", "content": " 福建省三明工贸学校是市属公办学校，位于福建省三明市宁化县中环北路138号。前身是创办于1978年的宁化师范学校，为三明市基础教育培养了7000余名中小学教师。2000年更为现名、正式举办中职教育；2004年被确定为省", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202103.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:34:00", "doctitle": "三明工贸学校", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412526, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202103.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202102, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202102.htm", "content": "    三明市实验幼儿园创建于1958年，前身为三明市市直机关幼儿园，1985年迁至新址，更名为“三明市实验幼儿园”。园所占地面积13.8亩，建筑面积9235.62平方米，是一所老牌的省级示范性幼儿园。现有32个教学", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202102.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:32:00", "doctitle": "三明市实验幼儿园", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412525, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202102.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2202100, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202100.htm", "content": "三明学院附属小学创建于1963年，前身是“三明市大桥小学”，2004年更名为三明学院附属小学。学校坐落于三明市区麒麟山脚下，学校含麒麟校区与台江校区，是三明市基础教育的示范“窗口”学校。\n学校确立了“从小事做起", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202100.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.15 09:27:00", "doctitle": "三明学院附属小学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2412520, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/t20260415_2202100.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1853132, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853132.htm", "content": "\n\n三明教育学院附属小学是公办市直属小学，占地面积24860m²，建筑面积17070m²，办学设施齐全、办学规模36个教学班，现有14个教学班、702名学生、40名教职工、高级教师6人，教师本科学历100%，市区两级骨干及学", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853132.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.30 15:52:00", "doctitle": "三明教育学院附属小学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1990476, "sourcename": "市教育局教育管理信息中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853132.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1853145, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853145.htm", "content": "\n\n\n三明市特殊教育学校创办于1992年9月，原名三明市聋哑学校，2001年改为现名。学校占地面积约17亩，建筑面积1.2万平方米，在校学生207人，教职工66人。经过多年发展，现已成为一所为听障、智障、视障和孤独症等特殊", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853145.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.23 15:52:00", "doctitle": "三明市特殊教育学校", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1990491, "sourcename": "市教育局教育管理信息中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853145.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1525627, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200427_1525627.htm", "content": "\n　　负责指导中小学校各类实验室、图书馆（室）、教育信息技术设备的配备、管理和使用工作；负责中小学信息技术教育的规划和实施；负责中小学校园网等网络建设管理；负责中小学统一着装、中小学生簿册、校方责任保险", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200427_1525627.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:56", "doctitle": "三明市教育技术装备服务站", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980048, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200427_1525627.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1525858, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200427_1525858.htm", "content": "\n　　承担全市中小学校教育质量评估监测、教育教学督导评估 ?办法和标准研究以及教育督导评估监测培训、组织、实施等工作。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200427_1525858.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:56", "doctitle": "三明市教育发展与评价中心", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980049, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200427_1525858.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1525893, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200428_1525893.htm", "content": "\n　　负责全市基础教育、职业教育、学前教育、特殊教育的教学研究、教学指导、教学质量监控和课程教材培训、教材建设；负责及时总结推广教学经验，积极推广教学科研成果，为全面提高教学质量提供有力的理论支撑和智力", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200428_1525893.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:56", "doctitle": "三明教育学院（福建广播电视大学三明分校）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980047, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200428_1525893.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1526107, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200428_1526107.htm", "content": "\n　　负责辖区内学生资助管理、普通话水平测试；负责辖区内学生资助管理、普通话水平测试及各类考试信息采集审验、各类教育考试大数据采集汇总。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200428_1526107.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:56", "doctitle": "三明市教育招生考试工作站（挂“市普通话水平测试站”、“市学生资助管理中心”牌子）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980050, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200428_1526107.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1526676, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200430_1526676.htm", "content": "\n三明市综合实践学校隶属于三明市教育局，是首批国家20个示范性综合实践基地之一，学校占地面积300亩，建筑面积4.1万平方米，总投入1.71亿元。设置生活区、运动区、室内实践区、室外实践区、拓展区、劳动区等6个区域", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200430_1526676.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:00", "doctitle": "三明市综合实践学校", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1980051, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/t20200430_1526676.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jggk/jsdw/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1853103, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853103.htm", "content": "\n\n\n　　三明市第九中学创办于1959年，前身是三明化工总厂中学，1998年6月从企业剥离，成为三明市教育局直属的高级中学，2006年5月被省教育厅确认为省一级达标中学（我省第一所跻身省一级达标中学的企业剥离学校），2", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853103.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:00", "doctitle": "三明市第九中学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1990441, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853103.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1853115, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853115.htm", "content": "\n\n\n三明市实验小学创建于1959年8月，前身为三明市红星小学、三明列东小学，2004年更名为现名，直属于三明市教育局。作为一所历史悠久、底蕴深厚、声誉卓著的省级示范小学，学校始终秉承“品位教育”的办学思想，以“", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853115.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:00", "doctitle": "三明市实验小学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1990455, "sourcename": "市教育局教育管理信息中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853115.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1853127, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853127.htm", "content": "\n\n\n三明市列东中学是三明市教育局直属初中校，1975年建校，1995年创办西藏班，2017年实行“总校制”办学，现有教职工199人，学生2710人。1999年3月5日，时任福建省委副书记习近平同志到我校视察并看望西藏班师生，并", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853127.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.22 15:52:00", "doctitle": "三明市列东中学", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1990470, "sourcename": "市教育局教育管理信息中心", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/t20221130_1853127.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ggqsy/jy_28776/202211/", "rels": []}]}